We’re looking for a Data Visualisation Analyst to join our client’s Data & AI team, with a strong focus on Qlik and Power BI.
You’ll work with customers and colleagues to understand business requirements and turn data into clear, trusted and impactful dashboards, reports and analytical solutions.
What you’ll do:
Design, develop and maintain Qlik Cloud and Power BI dashboards and reports;
Build and optimise data models, measures and business logic;
Use Qlik scripting, Set Analysis, DAX and Power Query;
Work with data from multiple sources and use SQL to query and validate data;
Translating business requirements into effective visualizations;
Test, troubleshoot and improve reporting solutions;
Support customers with deployment, administration and ongoing BI solutions;
Collaborate with consultants, data engineers and solution architects.
What we’re looking for:
Experience with Qlik Sense/Qlik Cloud and/or Power BI;
Strong understanding of data modelling and visualization;
Good SQL skills;
Experience working with business users and translating requirements into reporting solutions;
Strong analytical, problem-solving and communication skills;
A passion for developing expertise across both Qlik and Power BI;
Experience with both Qlik and Power BI is highly desirable.
